# The accessibility check installs its tools here (see tools/a11y/README.md).
tools/a11y/node_modules/
# The minifier and type checker for tools/build.py install here (see README.md, Build the small files).
tools/build/node_modules/
# Lighthouse CI for the checks (see tools/lighthouse/), and what it and the picture test write when they run.
tools/lighthouse/node_modules/
lighthouse-out/
.lighthouseci/
pictures-out/
# The guide's tools and build (see guide-src/README.md).
guide-src/node_modules/
guide-src/dist/
guide-src/.astro/
# The Ralph loop keeps its task, progress and logs here (see tools/ralph/README.md).
.ralph/
# Python leaves compiled files next to the tools and hooks when they run.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# The improve-ui skill writes its design plans here. Every file in the repo goes live on the site, so they stay out.
design-plans/
# Taste Skill (a global skill on the owner's Mac) keeps its build state and screenshots here. It is not used on loopy pages; see AGENTS.md.
.taste-skill/
# UI/UX Pro Max (another global skill on the Mac) writes its design systems here with --persist. Not for loopy pages; see AGENTS.md.
design-system/
tools/lint/node_modules/
